Write a user-scope service for `dreamd watch` and enable it now (Linux systemd --user / macOS LaunchAgent)

Usage: install [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --force
          Overwrite an existing LaunchAgent plist (macOS). No effect on Linux

  -h, --help
          Print help
